WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.775
A rule names a tag, then sets how every one of them looks

2
00:00:04.479 --> 00:00:08.279
A rule starts with a selector. p picks every paragraph.

3
00:00:09.054 --> 00:00:13.229
Inside the braces: a property, a colon, a value, a semicolon.

4
00:00:14.279 --> 00:00:18.404
Both paragraphs turn teal. The heading isn't a P, so it stays.

5
00:00:19.079 --> 00:00:23.529
Another rule styles the heading. The HTML does not change.
